  "details": "Running Discord as administrator or not having discord open at all on the new open-beta build will prevent VRChat from loading into the game and will get you stuck on the main loading screen while spamming 92 lines per second of:\n\nException  -  NullReferenceException: Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\nVRCApplication.Update () (at <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0)\n\nThis happens only on Open-beta due to Rich Presence being a new feature in it\n\nLogs: https://gist.github.com/nayutune/cfb35795b2c16f42600cda3635a9db59\n\nVideo: https://streamable.com/yn50ko (Client exit is called on purpose with alt+f4, otherwise it will just keep spamming)\n\nReproduction steps:\n[1]\n· Close Discord (Completely using windows tray too)\n· Open VRChat\n*Get Stuck*\n\n[2]\n· Make sure Discord is closed\n· Run Discord as Administrator\n· Open VRChat\n*Get Stuck*",
